      <div style="font-size: 1.3rem; margin-bottom: 8px;">🎛️</div>
      <h4 style="font-size: 0.9rem; margin-bottom: 4px; color: var(--text-primary); font-family: var(--font-title); font-weight: 700; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 5px;">Protecciones y Tableros <span style="font-size: 0.6rem; background: var(--accent); color: var(--text-dark); padding: 1px 4px; border-radius: 4px; font-weight: 800;">NUEVO</span></h4>
